  "problems": "Chart is published only as an image (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0252/1042/1345/files/COH_SIZE_CHART_WEBSITE_WOMENS_1_2048x2048.jpg); values read visually from the 1800x1200 image, worth a second visual check. Letter labels are published as X-SMALL/SMALL/MEDIUM/LARGE/X-LARGE (abbreviated here to XS..XL) and each spans two denim sizes; sizes 22, 23 and 34 have no letter, and 22-24 have no US size. US 10 spans 30-31 and US 12 spans 32-33. Inches also published (bust 29 1/2..41 1/2, waist 22 1/2..34 1/2, hip 32 1/2..44 1/2, in 1-inch steps). The page gives no body-vs-garment wording. No inseam chart; the separate Women's Denim Guide (citizensofhumanity.com/pages/womens-denim-guide) gives per-style garment specs (rise, leg opening, inseam) for a single sample size, not per-size rows, so it was not recorded."
